  "ingredients": [
    "4 ounce bacon",
    "2 tablespoon onion (diced)",
    "2 teaspoon sour cream",
    "1 tablespoon mayonnaise",
    "2 tablespoon heavy whipping cream",
    "1 tablespoon water",
    "1/2 teaspoon fresh dill (minced)",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "4 cup romaine lettuce (Torn in pieces)",
    "1/2 medium avocado (sliced)",
    "2 ounce cherry tomatoes"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Fry bacon in a large skillet over medium-low heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/avocado-blt-salad-with-sweet-onion-bacon-ranch-dressing/#wprm-recipe-52675-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/lemon-herb-chicken-salad-w-creamy-rosemary-vinegarette-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the bacon is crisp on both sides, remove from the pan to cool. Chop the bacon and set aside until you are ready to assemble your salad.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/avocado-blt-salad-with-sweet-onion-bacon-ranch-dressing/#wprm-recipe-52675-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/lemon-herb-chicken-salad-w-creamy-rosemary-vinegarette-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the remaining bacon fat, add the onion to the pan and cook on medium heat to caramelize.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/avocado-blt-salad-with-sweet-onion-bacon-ranch-dressing/#wprm-recipe-52675-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/lemon-herb-chicken-salad-w-creamy-rosemary-vinegarette-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dressing, combine the bacon drippings and onion in a jar or bowl with the dressing ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/avocado-blt-salad-with-sweet-onion-bacon-ranch-dressing/#wprm-recipe-52675-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/lemon-herb-chicken-salad-w-creamy-rosemary-vinegarette-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix well to combine. The dressing will be very thick due to the bacon fat and mayo. If you prefer a thinner dressing, thin the mixture with a little more water.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/avocado-blt-salad-with-sweet-onion-bacon-ranch-dressing/#wprm-recipe-52675-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/lemon-herb-chicken-salad-w-creamy-rosemary-vinegarette-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, layer your salad of romaine leaves, cherry tomatoes, avocado, and bacon.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/avocado-blt-salad-with-sweet-onion-bacon-ranch-dressing/#wprm-recipe-52675-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/lemon-herb-chicken-salad-w-creamy-rosemary-vinegarette-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle with dressing and serve!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/avocado-blt-salad-with-sweet-onion-bacon-ranch-dressing/#wprm-recipe-52675-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
